{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watara</strong> is a life simulation game enriched with adventure and exploration. You\u2019ll build a farm from the ground up, form meaningful relationships with villagers, uncover ancient mysteries, and interact with nature spirits known as <strong>Watapets</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a dynamic time system, seasonal changes, and evolving daily life, <strong>Watara</strong> invites players to experience a world where nature, history, and personal growth are deeply intertwined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and grow your farm across changing seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with diverse villagers with unique personalities and stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ancient ruins and mystical places hidden in nature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and bond with magical creatures called Watapets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day/night and seasonal cycles that affect gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully hand-crafted 2D environments with atmospheric music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the local traditions and spiritual beliefs of the Nusantara archipelago</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880180?t=1767925067","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880180/9564f120da81b079ff9ded7b9b97bd11060739e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767925067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880180/24a617608b70d1acf1b400bb1c5ad1ec76bc8e4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767925067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880180/24a617608b70d1acf1b400bb1c5ad1ec76bc8e4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767925067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description